{"1899120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shyftrs", "steam_appid": 1899120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/eee878bc6d0a3ae0db1c88a9927f846d.avif?t=1767503282\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras_big/eee878bc6d0a3ae0db1c88a9927f846d.avif?t=1767503282 width=800 height=258 /></span><strong>A Wonderful, Wicked World Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shyftrs</strong></i> is a 2D hand-drawn Metroidvania adventure where every step forward uncovers another world beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Brams Corvin, son of the prestigious House of Corvin, explorers of the unknown. When your parents vanish during a secret expedition, your search for answers shatters reality itself, sending you from Esos to the strange, luminous realm of Ikarus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten ruins, awaken lost technologies, and cross into the Astral World, a dimension where truth and illusion intertwine.<br>Forge your path through a land that breathes with forgotten gods and forbidden science, and unravel the secret your bloodline was never meant to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you return to Esos… or will Ikarus reshape your destiny forever?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>🔥 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized Hand-Drawn Art</strong><br>Every character, creature, and landscape is meticulously illustrated by hand, creating a world that feels both sketched and alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Interconnected Realms to Explore</strong><br>Traverse the dual dimensions of Ikarus and the Astral World, each packed with secrets, hidden paths, and lore-rich environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Dynamic Mix &amp; Match Combat System</strong><br>Craft your own combat style by combining skills unlocked through exploration, boss battles, crafting, and side quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Secrets Behind Every Shadow</strong><br>Discover hidden rooms, unlock rare relics, and uncover forgotten truths in a world that rewards exploration and curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉 <strong>100+ Unique Enemies</strong><br>Face an ever-expanding roster of enemies from twisted undead to bizarre creatures born from myth and madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 <strong>Custom Soundtrack &amp; Environmental Design</strong><br>An immersive original score and parallax-painted backdrops bring each biome to life with atmosphere and storytelling depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ASTRAL WORLD EXPLORATION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activate a Key Stone to travel back and forth between the Main world and Astral Realm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.poster.avif?t=1767503282\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.webm?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/a23451dbd8714503aaa92dc6f49c2836.mp4?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6b72e759be05858ac1dba5870c20ce4b.poster.avif?t=1767503282\" width=700 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6b72e759be05858ac1dba5870c20ce4b.webm?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6b72e759be05858ac1dba5870c20ce4b.mp4?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral World will have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tNew Level layout for player to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tNew Enemies and Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tNew Hidden treasures / relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><strong>ASTRAL ENEMIES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/378f00d6081024f9b41ad5c9b2d84854.poster.avif?t=1767503282\" width=800 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/378f00d6081024f9b41ad5c9b2d84854.webm?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/1390b1107ecedd12ec5c681b88debc1e.avif?t=1767503282\" width=1084 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/36c53b2476986b379a69d176f3f887a3.poster.avif?t=1767503282\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/36c53b2476986b379a69d176f3f887a3.webm?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/36c53b2476986b379a69d176f3f887a3.mp4?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new skills and abilities to overcome obstacles and explore deeper. Discover hidden pathways and choose how you tackle each challenge, your creativity shapes the journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/00fe714bd77c6cecd103e469d05fc2e4.poster.avif?t=1767503282\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/00fe714bd77c6cecd103e469d05fc2e4.webm?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/00fe714bd77c6cecd103e469d05fc2e4.mp4?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Adden in Ikarus will serve as the backdrop for the action, a land rich in magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will include a vast network of interconnected biomes, each with its unique biodiversity of flora and wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/de5297fe8063e4374c6da2ac81131a91.avif?t=1767503282\" width=600 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit our website to see major updates about the game and our future plans on the Update / Blog section.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c5736d1b5c29e86b8810b683523a9a98.poster.avif?t=1767503282\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c5736d1b5c29e86b8810b683523a9a98.webm?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c5736d1b5c29e86b8810b683523a9a98.mp4?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6377d006adafd9801baa9b81c2420ede.avif?t=1767503282\" width=600 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team has been working tirelessly to bring <i>Shyftrs</i> to life. Our first milestone was to secure initial funding to accelerate development, and we’re proud to share that we successfully received support from <strong>CODE NZ</strong>, first in <strong>December 2022</strong> and again in <strong>August 2024</strong>.<br>We’re deeply grateful to the CODE NZ team for their continued guidance and belief in <i>Shyftrs</i>’ vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6c8837519c5753686c94069e2882cac5.avif?t=1767503282\" width=400 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discord:  / X: @shyftrs / Bluesky: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/eee878bc6d0a3ae0db1c88a9927f846d.avif?t=1767503282\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras_big/eee878bc6d0a3ae0db1c88a9927f846d.avif?t=1767503282 width=800 height=258 /></span><strong>A Wonderful, Wicked World Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shyftrs</strong></i> is a 2D hand-drawn Metroidvania adventure where every step forward uncovers another world beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Brams Corvin, son of the prestigious House of Corvin, explorers of the unknown. When your parents vanish during a secret expedition, your search for answers shatters reality itself, sending you from Esos to the strange, luminous realm of Ikarus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten ruins, awaken lost technologies, and cross into the Astral World, a dimension where truth and illusion intertwine.<br>Forge your path through a land that breathes with forgotten gods and forbidden science, and unravel the secret your bloodline was never meant to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you return to Esos… or will Ikarus reshape your destiny forever?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>🔥 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized Hand-Drawn Art</strong><br>Every character, creature, and landscape is meticulously illustrated by hand, creating a world that feels both sketched and alive.</p></li><li><p class=