tem_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/de5297fe8063e4374c6da2ac81131a91.avif?t=1767503282\" width=600 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit our website to see major updates about the game and our future plans on the Update / Blog section.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c5736d1b5c29e86b8810b683523a9a98.poster.avif?t=1767503282\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c5736d1b5c29e86b8810b683523a9a98.webm?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/c5736d1b5c29e86b8810b683523a9a98.mp4?t=1767503282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899120/extras/6377d006adafd9801baa9b81c2420ede.avif?t=1767503282\" width=600 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team has been working tirelessly to bring <i>Shyftrs</i> to life. Our first milestone was to secure initial funding to accelerate development, and we’re proud to share that we successfully received support from <strong>CODE NZ</strong>, first in <strong>December 2022</strong> and again in <strong>August 2024</strong>.<br>We’re deeply grateful to the CODE NZ team for their continued guidance and belief in <i>Shyftrs</i>’ vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http